Short:        Sourcecode for 8-Way-Tile-Scroller
Uploader:     hollosi fm11ap01 tu-graz ac at
Type:         dev/source/asm
Version:      V1.04 (14.06.93)
Architecture: generic

Just a short example of how to code an 8-Way-Scroller using the
copper-wrap method (very fast, needs ca. 25 rasterlines on an A500,
only 10 (TEN!) rasterlines on an A4000).

Runs on every Amiga (A500-A4000); not recommended for OS-fanatics.

Author: Arno Hollosi
